{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/gsap/eventcallback/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>GSAP의 강력한 기능은 애니메이션의 콜백 처리다.<br>\n콜백의 종류, 매개변수, 범위에 대해서 알아본다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"eventcallback\" style=\"position:relative;\">eventCallback<a href=\"#eventcallback\" aria-label=\"eventcallback permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>콜백 함수에는 this바인딩 때문에 concise method를 사용하는 것이 좋다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.orange'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2.5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  \r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 애니메이션이 완료된 시점에 호출된다.</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">onComplete</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\t\t<span class=\"token comment\">// concise method</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">onComplete</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> complete<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  \r\n  <span class=\"token function\">onUpdate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">onStart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">onReverseComplete</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">onInterrupt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">onRepeat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span>